{
  "welcome": {
    "name": "Coursified B1 · Welcome",
    "subject": "Welcome — paste your first link",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Coursified</title>\n<style>\n/* Webfonts load where the client allows them (Apple Mail, iOS Mail,\n   Outlook macOS). Gmail and Outlook Windows strip webfonts entirely and\n   fall back to the Helvetica/Arial stacks — no email can change that. */\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n</style>\n<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width:480px){\n  .em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-panel{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-h1{font-size:21px !important}\n  .em-hero{font-size:23px !important}\n  .em-code{font-size:24px !important}\n  .em-btn{display:block !important;text-align:center !important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Any public YouTube video becomes a course in ~3 minutes.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:16px;\">\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"background-color:#2E5BFF;padding:32px 36px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:#FFFFFF;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px 3px 8px 3px;background-color:#0E0E0E;font-size:1px;line-height:16px;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Coursified</span>\n<div class=\"em-hero\" style=\"font-family:'Outfit','Century Gothic','Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.1;margin-top:20px;max-width:320px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Open videos in. Verified learning out.</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td><div class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:26px 36px 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Figtree',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A4A48;\">Hi {{trigger.firstName}} — you're in. Here's the whole product in three steps:</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #F0F0EE;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td width=\"26\" height=\"26\" align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#0E0E0E;border-radius:8px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;\">1</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:14px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><b>Paste a YouTube link.</b> <span style=\"color:#8A8A86;\">Talk, tutorial or playlist.</span></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #F0F0EE;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td width=\"26\" height=\"26\" align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#0E0E0E;border-radius:8px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:14px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><b>Learn with checks.</b> <span style=\"color:#8A8A86;\">AI notes, summaries, a quiz per module.</span></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #F0F0EE;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td width=\"26\" height=\"26\" align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#2E5BFF;border-radius:8px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;\">3</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:14px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><b>Earn the certificate.</b> <span style=\"color:#8A8A86;\">Verified page, LinkedIn-ready.</span></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px auto 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#0E0E0E;border-radius:10px;\"><a href=\"https://coursified.app/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"em-btn\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600;\">Convert your first video →</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:32px;font-size:1px;line-height:32px;\">&nbsp;</div></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:18px 36px;border-top:1px solid #F0F0EE;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;line-height:1.5;\">{{#if trigger.planLine}}{{trigger.planLine}}{{else}}You&#39;re on the free plan — 3 conversions/month.{{/if}}</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;white-space:nowrap;padding-left:14px;\"><a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#8A8A86;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "text": "Open videos in. Verified learning out.\n\nHi {{trigger.firstName}} — you're in. Here's the whole product in three steps:\n\n1. Paste a YouTube link. Talk, tutorial or playlist.\n2. Learn with checks. AI notes, summaries, a quiz per module.\n3. Earn the certificate. Verified page, LinkedIn-ready.\n\nConvert your first video: https://coursified.app/create\n\n—\n{{#if trigger.planLine}}{{trigger.planLine}}{{else}}You're on the free plan — 3 conversions/month.{{/if}}\nCoursified · coursified.app · hello@coursified.app"
  },
  "activationNudge": {
    "name": "Coursified B2 · Activation nudge",
    "subject": "That video you keep re-watching?",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Coursified</title>\n<style>\n/* Webfonts load where the client allows them (Apple Mail, iOS Mail,\n   Outlook macOS). Gmail and Outlook Windows strip webfonts entirely and\n   fall back to the Helvetica/Arial stacks — no email can change that. */\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n</style>\n<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width:480px){\n  .em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-panel{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-h1{font-size:21px !important}\n  .em-hero{font-size:23px !important}\n  .em-code{font-size:24px !important}\n  .em-btn{display:block !important;text-align:center !important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Paste it. Three minutes later it&#39;s a course.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:16px;\">\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:24px 36px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px 3px 8px 3px;background-color:#2E5BFF;font-size:1px;line-height:16px;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Coursified</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8A8A86;\">Getting started</td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td><div class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:8px 36px 0;\"><div class=\"em-h1\" style=\"font-family:'Outfit','Century Gothic','Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;color:#0E0E0E;\">Watching isn&#39;t the same as learning. You know this.</div><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A4A48;\">You signed up three days ago{{#if trigger.goal}} with a goal of <b>{{trigger.goal}}</b>. Learners with the same goal{{else}}. Learners like you{{/if}} started with these:</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0;\"><{{#each trigger.suggestions}}tr><td style=\"padding:3px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #F0F0EE;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><b>{{title}}</b> <span style=\"color:#8A8A86;font-weight:400;\">· {{metaLine}}</span></td><td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8A8A86;white-space:nowrap;\">{{cloneLabel}}</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr><{{/each}}/table><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:20px auto 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#0E0E0E;border-radius:10px;\"><a href=\"{{trigger.createUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"em-btn\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600;\">Paste your own link</a></td><td style=\"width:8px;font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #DADAD6;border-radius:10px;\"><a href=\"{{trigger.exploreUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"em-btn\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;color:#0E0E0E;font-weight:500;\">Clone one of these</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:30px;font-size:1px;line-height:30px;\">&nbsp;</div></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:18px 36px;border-top:1px solid #F0F0EE;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;line-height:1.5;\">One more nudge like this, then we stop.</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;white-space:nowrap;padding-left:14px;\"><a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#8A8A86;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "text": "Watching isn't the same as learning. You know this.\n\nYou signed up three days ago{{#if trigger.goal}} with a goal of {{trigger.goal}}. Learners with the same goal{{else}}. Learners like you{{/if}} started with these:\n\n{{#each trigger.suggestions}}- {{title}} · {{metaLine}} ({{cloneLabel}}){{#unless @last}}\n{{/unless}}{{/each}}\n\nPaste your own link: {{trigger.createUrl}}\nClone one of these: {{trigger.exploreUrl}}\n\n—\nOne more nudge like this, then we stop.\nCoursified · coursified.app · hello@coursified.app"
  },
  "streakRescue": {
    "name": "Coursified B3 · Streak rescue",
    "subject": "{{trigger.streakDays}} days, one evening from zero",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Coursified</title>\n<style>\n/* Webfonts load where the client allows them (Apple Mail, iOS Mail,\n   Outlook macOS). Gmail and Outlook Windows strip webfonts entirely and\n   fall back to the Helvetica/Arial stacks — no email can change that. */\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n</style>\n<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width:480px){\n  .em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-panel{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-h1{font-size:21px !important}\n  .em-hero{font-size:23px !important}\n  .em-code{font-size:24px !important}\n  .em-btn{display:block !important;text-align:center !important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">A {{trigger.shortestModuleMinutes}}-minute module keeps it alive.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:16px;\">\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:24px 36px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px 3px 8px 3px;background-color:#2E5BFF;font-size:1px;line-height:16px;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Coursified</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8A8A86;\">Streak</td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td><div class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:8px 36px 0;text-align:center;\"><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px auto 0;\"><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" style=\"width:110px;height:110px;border:12px solid #F5D328;border-radius:999px;background-color:#FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Outfit','Century Gothic','Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:500;color:#0E0E0E;line-height:1;\">{{trigger.streakDays}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#8A8A86;margin-top:2px;\">days</div>\n</td></tr></table><div style=\"height:18px;font-size:1px;line-height:18px;\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"em-h1\" style=\"font-family:'Outfit','Century Gothic','Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;color:#0E0E0E;text-align:center;\">Your streak ends at midnight.</div><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A4A48;text-align:center;\">{{trigger.streakWord}} days is {{#if trigger.personalBest}}your best{{else}}a real{{/if}} run. The shortest unwatched module in your pathway is {{trigger.shortestModuleMinutes}} minutes — that's all it takes.</p><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px auto 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#2E5BFF;border-radius:10px;\"><a href=\"{{trigger.resumeUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"em-btn\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600;\">Keep the streak · {{trigger.shortestModuleMinutes}} min</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:30px;font-size:1px;line-height:30px;\">&nbsp;</div></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:18px 36px;border-top:1px solid #F0F0EE;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;line-height:1.5;\">Streak reminders: evening before reset.</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;white-space:nowrap;padding-left:14px;\"><a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#8A8A86;text-decoration:underline;\">Mute streaks</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "text": "Your streak ends at midnight.\n\n{{trigger.streakWord}} days is {{#if trigger.personalBest}}your best{{else}}a real{{/if}} run. The shortest unwatched module in your pathway is {{trigger.shortestModuleMinutes}} minutes — that's all it takes.\n\nKeep the streak ({{trigger.shortestModuleMinutes}} min): {{trigger.resumeUrl}}\n\n—\nStreak reminders: evening before reset.\nCoursified · coursified.app · hello@coursified.app"
  },
  "retakeUnlocked": {
    "name": "Coursified B4 · Retake unlocked",
    "subject": "Round two: your retake is unlocked",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Coursified</title>\n<style>\n/* Webfonts load where the client allows them (Apple Mail, iOS Mail,\n   Outlook macOS). Gmail and Outlook Windows strip webfonts entirely and\n   fall back to the Helvetica/Arial stacks — no email can change that. */\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n</style>\n<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width:480px){\n  .em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-panel{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-h1{font-size:21px !important}\n  .em-hero{font-size:23px !important}\n  .em-code{font-size:24px !important}\n  .em-btn{display:block !important;text-align:center !important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Questions reshuffled. Your rewatch clips are queued.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:16px;\">\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:24px 36px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px 3px 8px 3px;background-color:#2E5BFF;font-size:1px;line-height:16px;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Coursified</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8A8A86;\">Assessment</td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td><div class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:8px 36px 0;\"><div class=\"em-h1\" style=\"font-family:'Outfit','Century Gothic','Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;color:#0E0E0E;\">{{trigger.score}}% wasn&#39;t the ending. It was a diagnosis.</div><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A4A48;\">Your retake for <b>{{trigger.courseTitle}}</b> is unlocked. You missed questions from {{trigger.modulesLabel}} — the exact clips are queued:</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0;\"><{{#each trigger.clips}}tr><td style=\"padding:3px 0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#F6F6F4;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td width=\"34\" height=\"24\" align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#0E0E0E;border-radius:6px;color:#F5D328;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">&#9654;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:12px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><b>{{title}}</b> &middot; {{metaLine}}</td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr><{{/each}}/table><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:20px auto 0;\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #0E0E0E;border-radius:10px;\"><a href=\"{{trigger.rewatchUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"em-btn\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;color:#0E0E0E;font-weight:600;\">Rewatch first · {{trigger.rewatchMinutes}} min</a></td><td style=\"width:8px;font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td><td style=\"background-color:#0E0E0E;border-radius:10px;\"><a href=\"{{trigger.retakeUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"em-btn\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600;\">Straight to retake</a></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:30px;font-size:1px;line-height:30px;\">&nbsp;</div></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:18px 36px;border-top:1px solid #F0F0EE;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;line-height:1.5;\">Pass mark {{trigger.passMark}}% · fresh question set.</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;white-space:nowrap;padding-left:14px;\"><a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#8A8A86;text-decoration:underline;\">Preferences</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "text": "{{trigger.score}}% wasn't the ending. It was a diagnosis.\n\nYour retake for {{trigger.courseTitle}} is unlocked. You missed questions from {{trigger.modulesLabel}} — the exact clips are queued:\n\n{{#each trigger.clips}}▶ {{title}} · {{metaLine}}{{#unless @last}}\n{{/unless}}{{/each}}\n\nRewatch first ({{trigger.rewatchMinutes}} min): {{trigger.rewatchUrl}}\nStraight to retake: {{trigger.retakeUrl}}\n\n—\nPass mark {{trigger.passMark}}% · fresh question set.\nCoursified · coursified.app · hello@coursified.app"
  },
  "winBack": {
    "name": "Coursified B5 · Win-back",
    "subject": "You{{#if trigger.pathwayCount}}r pathway is still {{trigger.pathwayCourses}} long{{else}} were {{trigger.progressPct}}% through {{trigger.courseTitle}}{{/if}}",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Coursified</title>\n<style>\n/* Webfonts load where the client allows them (Apple Mail, iOS Mail,\n   Outlook macOS). Gmail and Outlook Windows strip webfonts entirely and\n   fall back to the Helvetica/Arial stacks — no email can change that. */\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n</style>\n<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width:480px){\n  .em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-panel{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}\n  .em-h1{font-size:21px !important}\n  .em-hero{font-size:23px !important}\n  .em-code{font-size:24px !important}\n  .em-btn{display:block !important;text-align:center !important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Pick up where you left off — or shrink it to one.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ECECEA;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:16px;\">\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:24px 36px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:#0E0E0E;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:8px 3px 8px 3px;background-color:#2E5BFF;font-size:1px;line-height:16px;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Coursified</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8A8A86;\">We kept your place</td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td><div class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:8px 36px 0;\"><div class=\"em-h1\" style=\"font-family:'Outfit','Century Gothic','Trebuchet MS','Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;color:#0E0E0E;\">Nothing expired. Nothing reset.</div><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4A4A48;\">A month ago you were {{trigger.progressPct}}% through <b>{{trigger.courseTitle}}</b>{{#if trigger.hasQuizAvg}} with an {{trigger.quizAvgPct}}% quiz average{{/if}}. All of it is exactly where you left it.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0;\"><tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #F0F0EE;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;\">Resume · {{trigger.minutesLeft}} min left</div>\n<div style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;color:#0E0E0E;\">{{trigger.moduleTitle}}</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><tr>\n<td width=\"{{trigger.progressBarPct}}%\" style=\"height:6px;background-color:#2E5BFF;border-radius:999px;font-size:1px;line-height:6px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"height:6px;background-color:#F0F0EE;border-radius:999px;font-size:1px;line-height:6px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr></table>\n</td>\n<td width=\"12\" style=\"font-size:1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;\"><a href=\"{{trigger.resumeUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:10px;background-color:#0E0E0E;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">▶ Resume</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr></table><{{#if trigger.shrinkUrl}}p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-family:'Figtree',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#8A8A86;\">Pathway feels too big now? <a href=\"{{trigger.shrinkUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#0E0E0E;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">Shrink it to one course</a> — better one finished than four abandoned.</p><{{/if}}div style=\"height:30px;font-size:1px;line-height:30px;\">&nbsp;</div></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"em-pad\" style=\"padding:18px 36px;border-top:1px solid #F0F0EE;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;line-height:1.5;\">Last email unless you come back — promise.</td>\n<td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A8A86;white-space:nowrap;padding-left:14px;\"><a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#8A8A86;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "text": "Nothing expired. Nothing reset.\n\nA month ago you were {{trigger.progressPct}}% through {{trigger.courseTitle}}{{#if trigger.hasQuizAvg}} with an {{trigger.quizAvgPct}}% quiz average{{/if}}. All of it is exactly where you left it.\n\nResume ({{trigger.minutesLeft}} min left): {{trigger.moduleTitle}}\n{{trigger.resumeUrl}}\n\n{{#if trigger.shrinkUrl}}Pathway feels too big now? Shrink it to one course: {{trigger.shrinkUrl}}\n\n{{/if}}—\nLast email unless you come back — promise.\nCoursified · coursified.app · hello@coursified.app"
  },
  "upgradeToPro": {
